    "body": "Merge-time refresh by SKULL: merged upstream main (df90b031, which carries #1163/#1181) into the branch. New head **9673a77e**. Real conflicts, all resolved keeping both sides:\n\n- `crates/app/src/posting_wire.rs`: main's per-section post (#539 tab cut-off, `section()`) kept. The lean is now `Lean::Guides` (U/V, #536) or `Lean::Angle` (#1164). It is chosen once in `stream()`, with every refusal the PR adds: a 4-axis cut on an angle-word machine, an incomplete dialect, and a top that does not resolve. It is applied per section, and the PARAM order stays WireTaper, then the dialect, then WireFourAxis.\n- `crates/app/src/operation/wire_op.rs`: main's burnout clearance door, cut-off condition and 4-axis burnout/tabs refusals kept. `corner_rule` runs before the 4-axis branch, so a 4-axis cut on an angle-word machine is still refused at generation. `WireCondition` carries both `taper_angle` and main's flow.\n- `crates/post/src/machine/edm.rs`: main's strict key list and earlier `conditions` parse kept. `taper_angle` is added to `WIRE_KEYS`, because otherwise main's key law would refuse every angle-word machine file. It is parsed after `orbits`.\n- `crates/post/src/machine/mod.rs`, `crates/motion/src/wire_edm/mod.rs`, `crates/motion/src/wire_edm/taper.rs`: both sides' modules, exports and doc paragraphs kept.\n- Literal follow-ups: main's `open_tests.rs` and `tests/posted_gates/wire.rs` now state `corner: WireCorner::Mitre`. The PR's `wire_taper_angle.rs` states main's new `WireContourOp` fields (`tabs: None`, `capture: true`, `burnout: None`, `clearance: DEFAULT_CLEARANCE`), the same as main's `wire_taper.rs`.\n\n`git diff upstream/main --stat`: only the PR's own files, plus those two test literals.\n\nGate: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` green (post, motion, app; 0 failed, 3215 tests passed, 21.1 min). Pinning tests: `wire_taper_angle` 4/4, `the_cone_rule_holds_the_lean_and_refuses_a_lead_into_a_corner`, `taper_angle_words_parse_and_garbled_ones_refuse_the_file`, all ok. Golden `wire_taper_angle_punch.nc` byte-identical (unedited). `cargo clippy -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean. Main has since moved to 3ab3f015 (#1508, #1492), and a `git merge-tree` against it is clean.\n\nReady for review (M3/M5)\n",
